<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="AIspanda privacy information for the initial public website.">
  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Collect less. Explain clearly.</h1><p class="lede">This first public version is designed to work without accounts, advertising trackers, comments or application-owned personal data.</p></header>
  <div class="shell legal-copy">
    <h2>Website access</h2><p>The hosting platform may process technical request information needed to deliver and protect the site. AIspanda will document analytics separately before enabling them.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2><p>If you email AIspanda, your email provider and the receiving provider process the message. Do not send sensitive, confidential, financial, health or credential information through ordinary email.</p>
    <h2>Future capabilities</h2><p>Comments, accounts, contributions, newsletters and AI interactions are not active in this release. Their data, consent, moderation and retention rules will be published before activation.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:rajeevkasatai@gmail.com">rajeevkasatai@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
